      "Language": "pol",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The paper is a review of the surgical treatment of women intrapelvic endometriosis with attention to the extent of the intervention, the selection of appropriate procedure and employment different techniques and innovations in surgical therapy. Principles of the management of deep infiltrating endometriosis, methods of relieve the pelvic pain and the prevention of postoperative adhesion are also discussed."},
